  "description": {
    "en": "Number of population by statistical units. The statistical variables in the data are:\r\n\r\n- total population (vaesto),\r\n- share of the total population (vaesto_p)\r\n- number of men (miehet)\r\n- mens share of the population in an area (miehet_p)\r\n- number of women (naiset)\r\n- womens share (naiset_p)\r\n- those aged under 15: number (ika_0_14) and share (ika_0_14p),\r\n- those aged 15 to 64: number (ika_15_64) and share (ika_15_64p),\r\n- aged 65 or over: number (ika_65_)and share (ika_65_p).\r\n\r\nThe data is suitable for the examination of population distribution and making various regional analyses.\r\n\r\nFrom Statistics Finland WMS and WFS service also other statistical units are available: sub-regional units, regions, major regions, Regional State Administrative Agencies (AVI) and Centres for Economic Development, Transport and the Environment (ELY).\r\n\r\nAdditional information: [Statistics Finland, Population by municipality-based units](https://www.stat.fi/tup/rajapintapalvelut/vaesto_tilastointialueittain_en.html)\r\n\r\nThe data format has been changed to Shape at CSC. \r\n\r\nCoordinate Reference System: ETRS89 / ETRS-TM35FIN (EPSG:3067)"
